1
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:01,020
It's your turn.

2
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:02,620
Come on.

3
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:06,160
Hurry up.

4
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:08,820
Little bandit.

5
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:09,840
How did you get in?

6
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,560
What's the situation outside?

7
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:12,320
Li Chengrui

8
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:13,960
personally told the reporters

9
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:15,360
that you didn't have police permission

10
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:17,320
to trespass on a private residence in the concession.

11
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:19,120
It's perfectly legal for the police to arrest you.

12
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,960
Huo Qishan has already pressured Li Chengrui.

13
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:23,490
And the reporters are scrambling to cover it.

14
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:25,520
I guess the matter

15
00:01:25,720 --> 00:01:27,450
has already reached the mayor.

16
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:29,400
So this was a trap all along.

17
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:31,760
They deliberately set it up to lure us in.

18
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:32,520
And

19
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,880
once we go to a military court,

20
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:34,880
it'll be too late.

21
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:36,729
Don't worry.

22
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,440
I'll find a way to get you out.

23
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:03,760
Next,

24
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:06,240
as soon as the gavel falls in the concession court,

25
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:07,840
everything will be settled.

26
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:44,730
Let's go.

27
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,160
I knew you would come.

28
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:48,680
There's no time to explain.

29
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,360
Come with me.

30
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:49,640
Go.

31
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:57,890
Zhou Wei,

32
00:02:58,079 --> 00:02:58,810
are you okay?

33
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:26,440
Grenade!

34
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:44,880
Siyao.

35
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:50,480
Slow down.

36
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,730
Don't worry.

37
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:58,980
It's safe here.

38
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,240
Lin Jinwen,

39
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:09,320
Why did you fake your death when you're fine?

40
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:11,240
Five years ago, you impersonated Lin Jinwen

41
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:13,920
and started laying out your plan after entering the police station.

42
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:16,240
After Wei Xiaodong's case was suppressed,

43
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,170
you founded the Jingxiang Society

44
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:21,500
to fully prepare for the current case to cause a sensation.

45
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,760
Then you faked your death scene

46
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:26,000
and used me to investigate the case for you.

47
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,330
Every step was carefully designed by you,

48
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:29,800
right?

49
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,800
Lin Yousheng.

50
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:33,920
You are the Lin Yousheng

51
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,360
who killed Father John.

52
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,890
So was my father's death

53
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,000
also part of your plan?

54
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:44,130
Absolutely not.

55
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,620
About Dad's death,

56
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:47,960
I am also very sorry.

57
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:48,640
Shut up.

58
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:50,760
He is not your dad.

59
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:55,810
I am the one who let you down.

60
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,600
You can kill me,

61
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:58,720
but only after I kill those

62
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,280
traitors who are still at large.

63
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:01,040
My life

64
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,730
is at your disposal.

65
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,220
You approached me,

66
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:06,600
deceived me and used me.

67
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,760
It was you

68
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:09,340
who ruined my life.

69
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,660
Lin Jinwen,

70
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,520
I will never forgive you.

71
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,280
Siyao.

72
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,360
You should be glad

73
00:05:37,159 --> 00:05:38,560
that I am a police officer

74
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:42,000
and cannot kill you myself.

75
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:58,280
You are no longer qualified to get close to her.

76
00:05:58,280 --> 00:06:00,140
I don't have the right, but you do.

77
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,480
How long have you even known her?

78
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:03,610
Does it matter how long I've known her?

79
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,760
She's homeless now.

80
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:27,960
How is it?

81
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,440
Life on the run isn't easy, is it?

82
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:34,600
Not as glorious as being the head of the Huo family.

83
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,760
I'm on the run with my senior sister.

84
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,159
I'm happy to do it.

85
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:40,420
When you saved me just now,

86
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:41,800
you dragged me so far.

87
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,960
I thought you cared about me.

88
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,960
Isn't feeding you enough?

89
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:47,610
It's enough.

90
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:59,240
If you're sad, just cry.

91
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,420
I don't want to cry.

92
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,600
I just need some time.

93
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:05,690
Don't worry.

94
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:07,770
No matter what happens,

95
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,490
I will stay by your side.

96
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,080
Ayao.

97
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,240
Can you give me a few minutes?

98
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:37,560
I've never had a normal life since I was a child.

99
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,960
You can't even imagine

100
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:41,000
what it feels like to be abused.

101
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,440
So you chose to lie to me

102
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,570
and treat me like a fool.

103
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,320
Since I met you,

104
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:48,850
I've experienced unprecedented warmth.

105
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:52,720
Your warmth is built on the suffering of others.

106
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,940
But I often reflect on myself too.

107
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:59,560
The girls in the Jingxiang Society,

108
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,320
which one of them isn't innocent?

109
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:03,320
The mastermind behind the Jingxiang Society is someone else.

110
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:05,120
I infiltrated it and became the master

111
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,800
to find out who the mastermind is.

112
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,960
I know that person has immense power.

113
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:11,720
After finding Lei Lie's men and the place where the drugs were hidden,

114
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,840
I killed the assassin instead.

115
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:14,200
But I never thought...

116
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:17,890
I never thought about running away from the wedding.

117
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,960
Give me back my necklace.

118
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,460
I'm returning this to you.

119
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:31,420
Lin Jinwen.

120
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:34,220
I will keep investigating this case.

121
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,299
But not for you.

122
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,520
It's for those innocent girls.

123
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:40,760
Now please get out.

124
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:51,240
The day you faked your death,

125
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,320
the corpse's arm

126
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,720
had three scars exactly like yours.

127
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:55,620
Why is that?

128
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,320
Do you know why George

129
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,820
doesn't have any tattoos?

130
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,840
The Celts living in Scotland

131
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,360
know a traditional skin grafting technique

132
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,720
that leaves no trace.

133
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:06,720
I learned this skin grafting technique from George.

134
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,760
So George also used this skin grafting technique

135
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:10,020
to remove his tattoos.

136
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,280
But

137
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:13,820
we are all wanted across the city now.

138
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,200
How can we continue investigating?

139
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:17,120
They have an organization called the Satanic Sanctuary,

140
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,840
which has harmed many young boys and girls.

141
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,240
The pile of bones in the suburbs

142
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,960
is the evidence of their hidden corpses.

143
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:22,760
Moreover,

144
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,160
their protective umbrella

145
00:09:24,160 --> 00:09:25,160
is our mayor,

146
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,560
Zeng Guoquan.

147
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:29,380
The pile of bones in the suburbs is all bones,

148
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:32,320
but my brothers from Xinfeng Stronghold have only been missing for a year.

149
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,640
Even if they are dead,

150
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,480
they wouldn't have turned into bones.

151
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,810
Where on earth are they?

152
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:39,200
St. Faci Hotel.

153
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:40,600
St. Faci Hotel

154
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,440
is the venue of the Satanic Sanctuary.

155
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:42,900
George,

156
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:43,560
John,

157
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:44,410
and Peter

158
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:45,780
are all their members.

159
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,200
There are twelve people in total.

160
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,200
The identities of the other three are unclear.

161
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,000
They are

162
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:52,520
Gordon, General Manager of Yinghua Department Store,

163
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:54,880
Wallace, Counselor of the British Consulate,

164
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:57,480
and Hunter, Director of the Bureau of Industry and Commerce in the British Concession.

165
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:59,160
Only by finding the leader of this organization

166
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:00,690
can we completely crush it.

167
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,720
This list is not simple.

168
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:04,440
It seems

169
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:06,560
we are going to turn the whole concession

170
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:07,960
upside down.

171
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,600
Who could this leader be?

172
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,000
It must be Mayor Zeng.

173
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,840
The tattoo on this leader

174
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,320
is different from the others.

175
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:16,120
Above his colorful banded krait,

176
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,120
there is a bident.

177
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,560
Young Master.

178
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:30,250
Tomorrow at 3:00 PM,

179
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:32,000
Wallace, the counselor of the British Consulate,

180
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:33,800
will attend a reception across the street.

181
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:35,330
Find a way to get close to him

182
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:37,560
and see if he has this tattoo.

183
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,080
Okay.

184
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:46,850
Let's go.

185
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,280
How about

186
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,760
I give you a massage?

187
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:10,200
Have a taste.

188
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,560
Freshly steamed hot buns.

189
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:12,420
Please come in.

190
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:14,320
Siyao,

191
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:15,490
do you remember?

192
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,760
We used to

193
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:18,220
come to this bun shop a lot.

194
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,360
Boss,

195
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:22,320
the usual.

196
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:23,760
Okay.

197
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,180
Here are your buns.

198
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:30,450
Enjoy your meal.

199
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,780
They're still hot.

200
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:33,480
Eat them while they're hot,

201
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,320
or they'll get cold.

202
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,380
Did you forget what you came here for?

203
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,160
Investigating a case.

204
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:40,960
Glad you know.

205
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,320
Eat it yourself.
